    "enUS": {
      "description": "Let's try something else. You see that branch up there? Yep! That one. I need you to break it for me. I've got plenty of ropes tangled elsewhere, so there's no chance for catastrophic failure... I hope.\r\n\r\nTake a safe step back and take a few swings at this branch, would you?\r\n\r\n<Fenwick gestures at something above his head.>\r\n\r\nPlease be careful!",
      "objectiveLines": [
